    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/f742018529bda347a852a8a09fe53e63.poster.avif?t=1739359403\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/f742018529bda347a852a8a09fe53e63.webm?t=1739359403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/f742018529bda347a852a8a09fe53e63.mp4?t=1739359403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AGAINST HUMANITY.</h2>The game features six stages taking place during judgement day 2351. Fight from the depths of hell up until the gates of heaven and everything in between with a finale above a crowd of 60000 cultists.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/ca143e6c68a445ce14cebf7fdae58e42.poster.avif?t=1739359403\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/ca143e6c68a445ce14cebf7fdae58e42.webm?t=1739359403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/ca143e6c68a445ce14cebf7fdae58e42.mp4?t=1739359403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION MECH COMBAT</h2>The game is a crossover between a fighting game and an arena shooter. Fight one on one against a mech and use various abilities triggered by key combos to destroy your opponent.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/223ae9456d8a83b5978bf86feffe41f8.poster.avif?t=1739359403\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/223ae9456d8a83b5978bf86feffe41f8.webm?t=1739359403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964040/extras/223ae9456d8a83b5978bf86feffe41f8.mp4?t=1739359403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIX PLAYABLE MECHS</h2>Play as one of six mechs representing the forces of doom. Fight as dawnbringer dual wielding giant swords or use the brute force of a giant minigun when playing as wrath.",
